<Article title="Contact DeadHangs | Corrections & Partnerships" description="Contact DeadHangs about a content correction, a tool problem or a relevant partnership. Include the page and details so we can investigate.">
<div class="article-header"><h1 class="article-h1">Contact DeadHangs</h1><p class="article-subtitle">Found a problem with a guide or tool? Send the page and what happened.</p></div><div class="article-body"><h2>Content and tool feedback</h2><p>Include the page URL, a brief description and your browser or device if the problem is technical. Do not include medical records or sensitive personal details. DeadHangs cannot provide individual medical advice.</p><a class="dh-btn" href="mailto:hello@sunnypatel.co.uk?subject=DeadHangs%20feedback">Email DeadHangs</a><p class="small-copy">Opens your email app. You can also write to hello@sunnypatel.co.uk and put “DeadHangs” in the subject. Your message is sent only when you send it in your mail app.</p><h2>Partnerships</h2><p>Describe your product or proposal and any commercial relationship. Product access or a partnership does not imply a review, endorsement or guaranteed placement.</p><h2>Using the tools</h2><p>The <a href="/training-log/">timer and training log</a> work without an account. Log entries stay in your browser. Export a copy before changing devices or clearing site data.</p></div></Article>
